<title>USA: Guitar Center to buy Rhythm City.</title>
<headline>Guitar Center to buy Rhythm City.</headline>
<dateline>AGOURA HILLS, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guitar Center Inc said it entered a definitive agreement to acquire Rhythm City Inc, which operates two musical instrument stores around Atlanta.</p>
<p>The purchase price will consist of $10.3 million in cash.</p>
